# Module failure lines, and the operation that names one
# RUN: round-trip
# CHECK: module m0 path="/a.ts" displayPath="a.ts" body=f0
# CHECK-NEXT: module m1 path="/b.ts" displayPath="b.ts"
# CHECK-NEXT: modulefailure q0 importer=m0 specifier=""
# CHECK-NEXT: modulefailure q1 importer=m1 specifier="./missing"
# CHECK-NEXT: function f0 module=m0 kind=Module thisType={type=anything} results=[{type=anything}]
# CHECK-NEXT: b0():
# CHECK-NEXT: v0 = ThrowModuleFailure failure=q1
# CHECK-NEXT: Unreachable
# CHECK-NEXT: }
# CHECK-NEXT: entry module=m0
# CHECK-NEXT: round trip: same
# RUN(V): verify
# V: valid

module m0 path="/a.ts" displayPath="a.ts" body=f0
module m1 path="/b.ts" displayPath="b.ts"
modulefailure q0 importer=m0 specifier=""
modulefailure q1 importer=m1 specifier="./missing"
function f0 module=m0 kind=Module thisType={type=anything} results=[{type=anything}] {
    v0 = ThrowModuleFailure failure=q1
    Unreachable
}
entry module=m0
